{"2666270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Da Vinci Cryptex", "steam_appid": 2666270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras/2581252718d3e1903bbc6afe706ae229.avif?t=1785761345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras_big/2581252718d3e1903bbc6afe706ae229.avif?t=1785761345 width=1560 height=234 /></span>Trapped in a room of the Italian genial inventor, you need to think out of the box to solve logical enigmas written in a book and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the answers, unlock the Cryptex, and see what awaits you in the next room! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras/2b0a90da73c60269f160456469d75d80.avif?t=1785761345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras_big/2b0a90da73c60269f160456469d75d80.avif?t=1785761345 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex</strong> is a brainteasing game consisting of 50 unique riddles; the more you go on, the harder the puzzles become</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, how many puzzles will you crack?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: this IQ game may be addictive!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras/ee7610421e295c8adb2f149a558411fe.avif?t=1785761345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras_big/ee7610421e295c8adb2f149a558411fe.avif?t=1785761345 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 50 unique handcrafted puzzles </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hints available (click the bulb button to get a hint) </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astonishing graphics∑</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating background music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're a fan of puzzles, word games, brain thinking, mind games, logic riddles, and enigmas, The Da Vinci Cryptex is the game for you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785761345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785761345 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras/2581252718d3e1903bbc6afe706ae229.avif?t=1785761345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666270/extras_big/2581252718d3e1903bbc6afe706ae229.avif?t=1785761345 width=1560 height=234 /></span>Trapped in a room of the Italian genial inventor, you need to think out of the box to solve logical enigmas written in a book and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the answers, unlock the Cryptex, and see what awaits you in the next room! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><i